  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Creamy cucumber salad is a cool, refreshing side dish made with crisp cucumber slices tossed in a smooth Greek yogurt dressing with a touch of tangy vinegar. Fresh herbs like dill and mint, along with garlic and a hint of sweetness, add bright, balanced flavor to every bite. Light, crunchy, and easy to prepare, creamy cucumber salad is perfect served chilled alongside grilled dishes or as a fresh addition to any summer meal.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-creamy-cucumber-salad\">Why You’ll Love This creamy cucumber salad</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-creamy-cucumber-salad\">How to Make Creamy Cucumber Salad</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-creamy-cucumber-salad\">Pro Tips for Making Creamy Cucumber Salad</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-creamy-cucumber-salad\">How to Serve this creamy cucumber salad</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-creamy-cucumber-salad\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This creamy cucumber salad</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>It&#8217;s a refreshing dish that cools you down on hot days.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Quick to prepare, making it perfect for busy weeknights.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Loaded with nutrients, it&#8217;s a guilt-free indulgence.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Versatile enough to pair with any meal or enjoy on its own.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Its creamy texture makes healthy eating feel like a treat!</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-12648\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"12648\" data-servings=\"4\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-meadow\"><div class=\"wprm-layout-container wprm-padding-40 meadow-header\">\n  <div class=\"wprm-layout-column-container wprm-column-gap-20 wprm-column-rows-recipe-600 wprm-column-rows-reverse wprm-row-gap-20 meadow-header-columns\">\n    <div class=\"wprm-layout-column wprm-align-center\">\n      <div class=\"wprm-recipe-image wprm-block-image-rounded\"><img decoding=\"async\" style=\"border-width: 0px;border-style: solid;border-color: #666666;border-radius: 20px;width: 300px;max-width: 100%;height: 300px;object-fit: cover;\" width=\"533\" height=\"300\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Refreshing-Creamy-Cucumber-Salad.webp\" class=\"attachment-999999x300 size-999999x300\" alt=\"A bowl of creamy cucumber salad with sliced cucumbers and red onions, garnished with dill.\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Refreshing-Creamy-Cucumber-Salad.webp 1200w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Refreshing-Creamy-Cucumber-Salad-300x169.webp 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Refreshing-Creamy-Cucumber-Salad-1024x576.webp 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Refreshing-Creamy-Cucumber-Salad-768x432.webp 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Refreshing-Creamy-Cucumber-Salad-480x270.webp 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 533px) 100vw, 533px\" /></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"wprm-layout-column wprm-column-width-75 wprm-align-rows-center\">\n      <div class=\"wprm-layout-container meadow-header-accent\" style=\"--wprm-layout-container-text-color: var(--meadow-accent-color);\">\n        \n      </div>\n      <h2 class=\"wprm-recipe-name wprm-block-text-bold\">creamy cucumber salad</h2>\n      <div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 15px;\"></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 15px;\"></div>\n      <div class=\"wprm-recipe-summary wprm-block-text-normal\">Discover a quick and healthy creamy cucumber salad recipe! 🥒✨ Refresh your meals with this deliciously creamy and crunchy delight!</div>\n      <div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"hei